WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.100
Grok can't see your business, so tell it.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.210
Say who you are, what a good answer looks like,

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.930
give an example if you have one,

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:12.139
and end with: ask me anything you need to know first.

